{
  "file": "Latent",
  "page": 20,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        54.572994232177734,
        526.5960083007812,
        67.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "effect depends on the level of confidence in that estimate: the higher the quality of evidence, the more likely",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        68.57299041748047,
        526.7123413085938,
        81.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "a strong recommendation can be made. A decision on the strength of the evidence also depends on other",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        82.57299041748047,
        526.6112670898438,
        95.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "factors. The strength of a recommendation reflects the degree of confidence of the GDG that the desirable",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        96.57299041748047,
        526.6343383789062,
        109.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "effects outweigh the undesirable effects. The desirable effects included beneficial health outcomes (e.g.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        110.57299041748047,
        526.658447265625,
        123.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "prevention and early diagnosis of TB, reduced TB-related morbidity and mortality), a smaller burden of TB and",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        124.57299041748047,
        526.6343994140625,
        137.37298583984375
      ],
      "text": "more savings; whereas the undesirable effects include harm, a greater burden and more costs. The “burdens”",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        138.572998046875,
        526.6823120117188,
        151.37298583984375
      ],
      "text": "included adherence to the recommendations by programmes, patients and caregivers (e.g. families), such as",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        152.572998046875,
        300.6881103515625,
        165.37298583984375
      ],
      "text": "more frequent tests and taking additional medications.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.24298095703125,
        302.5931701660156,
        185.04296875
      ],
      "text": "The quality of evidence was categorized into four levels:",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        191.9129638671875,
        490.10614013671875,
        204.71295166015625
      ],
      "text": "We are very confident that the true effect lies close to that of the estimate of the effect. High",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        211.58294677734375,
        526.6250610351562,
        224.3829345703125
      ],
      "text": "We are moderately confident that the true effect is likely to be close to the estimate of the effect,  Moderate",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.56610107421875,
        225.58294677734375,
        357.39007568359375,
        238.3829345703125
      ],
      "text": "but there is a possibility that it is substantially different.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8760986328125,
        245.2529296875,
        514.1660766601562,
        258.05291748046875
      ],
      "text": "Our confidence in the effect estimate is limited: the true effect may be substantially different. Low",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8760986328125,
        264.92291259765625,
        526.698974609375,
        277.722900390625
      ],
      "text": "We have very little confidence in the effect estimate: the true effect is likely to be substantially  Very low",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.56610107421875,
        278.92291259765625,
        165.5421142578125,
        291.722900390625
      ],
      "text": "different.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8760986328125,
        298.5928955078125,
        380.01019287109375,
        311.39288330078125
      ],
      "text": "The recommendations in these guidelines are either strong or conditional.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8760986328125,
        318.26287841796875,
        526.7183227539062,
        331.0628662109375
      ],
      "text": "A   recommendation is one for which the GDG was confident that the desirable effects of adherence  strong",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8760986328125,
        332.26287841796875,
        481.6043395996094,
        345.0628662109375
      ],
      "text": "would outweigh the undesirable effects. This could be either in favour of or against an intervention.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8760986328125,
        351.9328918457031,
        526.64013671875,
        364.7328796386719
      ],
      "text": "A   recommendation is one for which the GDG concluded that the desirable effects of adherence  conditional",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.87606811523438,
        365.9328918457031,
        526.7153930664062,
        378.7328796386719
      ],
      "text": "would probably outweigh the undesirable effects, but the GDG was not confident about the trade-off.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.87606811523438,
        379.9328918457031,
        526.6631469726562,
        392.7328796386719
      ],
      "text": "The reasons for lack of confidence included: absence of high-quality evidence (few data to support the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.87606811523438,
        393.9328918457031,
        526.6292114257812,
        406.7328796386719
      ],
      "text": "recommendation); imprecise estimates of benefit or harm (new evidence might change the ratio of risk to",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.87606811523438,
        407.9328918457031,
        526.7232666015625,
        420.7328796386719
      ],
      "text": "benefit); uncertainty or variation in the value of the outcomes for different individuals (applicable only to a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.87606811523438,
        421.9328918457031,
        526.6701049804688,
        434.7328796386719
      ],
      "text": "specific group, population or setting); and small benefits or benefits that might not be worth the cost (including",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.87606811523438,
        435.9328918457031,
        272.2461242675781,
        448.7328796386719
      ],
      "text": "the cost of implementing the recommendation).",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        463.8861999511719,
        382.8582458496094,
        480.6692199707031
      ],
      "text": "1.7\t Publication, implementation, evaluation and expiry",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        486.6045227050781,
        526.7153930664062,
        499.4045104980469
      ],
      "text": "These guidelines will be published on the WHO website in at least four languages (English, French, Spanish",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        500.6045227050781,
        526.7060546875,
        513.404541015625
      ],
      "text": "and Russian) and can be downloaded freely. The printed guidelines will be widely distributed at international",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        514.6044921875,
        526.67724609375,
        527.4044799804688
      ],
      "text": "and regional conferences and meetings of programme managers in all regions. Implementation of the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.6044921875,
        526.6292724609375,
        541.4044799804688
      ],
      "text": "recommendations will be monitored regularly in the annual data collection system of WHO Global TB Data",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        542.6044921875,
        526.6743774414062,
        555.4044799804688
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring. WHO will update the guidelines 5 years after their publication or earlier if new evidence becomes",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        556.6044921875,
        227.02110290527344,
        569.4044799804688
      ],
      "text": "available that necessitates a revision.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        584.5632934570312,
        397.0997619628906,
        601.3463134765625
      ],
      "text": "1.8\t Presentation of the guidelines and recommendations",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        607.28173828125,
        526.6721801757812,
        620.0817260742188
      ],
      "text": "The overall structure of these guidelines and the recommendations follow the logical cascade of management",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        621.28173828125,
        526.6512451171875,
        634.0817260742188
      ],
      "text": "of LTBI: identification of at-risk populations (adults and children living with HIV, HIV-negative adult and child",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        635.28173828125,
        526.7080688476562,
        648.0817260742188
      ],
      "text": "contacts of TB cases and other HIV-negative at-risk groups); ruling out active TB disease; testing for LTBI;",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        649.28173828125,
        526.6971435546875,
        662.0817260742188
      ],
      "text": "providing treatment; monitoring adverse events; adherence to and completion of treatment; and monitoring",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        663.28173828125,
        526.6723022460938,
        676.0817260742188
      ],
      "text": "and evaluation. The recommendations are categorized as   (recommendations that were published in  existing",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        677.28173828125,
        526.6600952148438,
        690.0817260742188
      ],
      "text": "previous guidelines approved by the review committee and are still valid);   (recommendations that  updated",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        691.28173828125,
        526.7083740234375,
        704.0817260742188
      ],
      "text": "were published in previous guidelines approved by the review committee, for which the evidence was reviewed,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        705.28173828125,
        526.6723022460938,
        718.0817260742188
      ],
      "text": "discussed in the GDG and updated, including for clarity); and   (recommendations that were made for the  new",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        719.28173828125,
        153.7751007080078,
        732.0817260742188
      ],
      "text": "current guidelines).",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        47.524898529052734,
        790.2608032226562,
        56.69289779663086,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "8",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        796.524658203125,
        458.3740539550781,
        805.5686645507812
      ],
      "text": "LATENT TUBERCULOSIS INFECTION: UPDATED AND CONSOLIDATED GUIDELINES FOR PROGRAMMATIC MANAGEMENT",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}